---Streams live ref (branch/tag/HEAD) changes as they happen — a push, not a poll — with rapid updates to the same ref coalesced to at most one event roughly every 200ms. On connect you get a snapshot of current refs, then only changes from that point on; there is no history to replay, so a reconnect re-snapshots rather than catching up on what it missed.
---
---Use an own-account bearer token (including supported service accounts) or a Core-issued plugin installation bearer token, subject to the permissions and restrictions below. Plugin assertion JWTs and plugin OAuth user-delegation tokens are not accepted here.
